@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@email = profile-test@example.com
@password = 1234
@sampleAvatar = 

### Registrar cuenta para probar el perfil · 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Login · 200
# @name profileLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Cambiar el nombre y subir un JPEG de prueba · 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{profileLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"display_name":"Perfil de prueba","avatar_jpeg":"{{sampleAvatar}}"}

### Descargar el avatar · 200 image/jpeg
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{profileLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Quitar el avatar · 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{profileLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"display_name":"Perfil de prueba","remove_avatar":true}

### Consultar perfil · 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{profileLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Eliminar cuenta de prueba · 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{profileLogin.response.body.$.token}}
